@base = https://onestreamrpg.pauledevelopment.com
@channelId = 973731649

### Discovery — is this broadcaster running the game, and where?
GET {{base}}/api/lobby/status/{{channelId}}

### Metadata (lobby-independent, served by the gateway itself)
GET {{base}}/api/metadata

### Socket.IO handshake for a lobby (what the extension connects to)
GET {{base}}/l/{{channelId}}/socket.io/?EIO=4&transport=polling

### Streamer login — step 1: get a pairing code and a URL to open in a browser
GET {{base}}/api/auth/device/new

### Streamer login — step 4: poll until the browser half completes
GET {{base}}/api/auth/device/poll?code=PASTE_DEVICE_CODE

### Start a lobby as the authenticated streamer
POST {{base}}/api/lobby/start
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_HOST_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### LEGACY — unauthenticated spawn, for the un-migrated GameMaker client
POST {{base}}/api/lobby
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "hostId": "{{channelId}}"
}
